@LCMS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Health
GET {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Ready
GET {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/ready

### Create tenant
POST {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "DEMO",
  "name": "Thuê bao demo"
}

### Get tenant (replace id)
GET {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create bill (requires X-Tenant-Id)
POST {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

{
  "billNo": "BL-2026-0001",
  "billType": "freight",
  "sourceSystem": "ops",
  "externalId": "OPS-1001"
}

### Get bill
GET {{LCMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bills/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
